AC2  React: tsc -b && vite build lulus; oxlint 0 error.
AC3  Tidak ada scroll horizontal pada 7 lebar layar di §4.1 untuk: /, popup login, /login/whatsapp,
     /onboarding, /dashboard (admin & member), /dashboard/gateway/*. Bukti: screenshot/headless check.
