8. ATURAN DOKUMEN
==================================================================================================
- File workflow: PRD.prd (ini), WORKTASK.prd, HANDOFF.prd, DECISIONS.prd, API_CONTRACT.prd,
  DEPLOYMENT.prd, TEST_REPORT.prd, WORKFLOW.prd — semua di root wa-gateway. Encoding UTF-8.
- JANGAN menimpa riwayat: tambahkan entri baru bertanggal (WIB). Catat agent pemilik setiap entri.
- Status task: TODO | IN_PROGRESS | BLOCKED | DONE. Tahap validasi: NOT_TESTED | LOCAL_VERIFIED |
  READY_TO_DEPLOY | DEPLOYED | VPS_VERIFIED. Jangan menaikkan tahap tanpa bukti.
- Jangan menyentuh README.md, LICENSE, CHANGELOG.md, dokumentasi upstream, atau
  laravel-headless-starter\PRD.md / PLAN.md (dokumen asli starter milik pemilik).

